    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This restraint ensures that a set of particles are similar to a set of EM images. The restraint generates projections of the model that are then compared with the EM images. The projections are generated from the radius of its particles. In the case of atoms, the radius is generated automatically. For other particles the radius has to be provided. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
